# deepseek41 iqr3s: routed experts of layers 0-39 as IQR-V4 computed trellis (make_iqr_recipe.py), 3.172 bpw, 200.7 GiB of experts; the rest = ref-q8dense-iq4engram.recipe's rules (DSpark experts MXFP4 as shipped).
# Needs CALIB=<RADGRAM2 dir from the reference's calibration run>. Convert on cards: rad-convert --gpus 0,1,2,3 ... --reuse <reference .rad> [--reuse <an earlier IQR mix>]
# forms by layer: 0:gu3/dn3 1:gu3/dn3 2:gu3/dn3 3:gu3/dn3 4:gu3/dn3 5:gu3/dn3 6:gu3/dn3 7:gu3/dn3 8:gu3/dn3 9:gu3/dn3 10:gu3/dn3 11:gu3/dn3 12:gu3/dn4 13:gu3/dn4 14:gu3/dn4 15:gu3/dn4 16:gu3/dn4 17:gu3/dn4 18:gu3/dn4 19:gu3/dn4 20:gu3/dn4 21:gu3/dn4 22:gu3/dn4 23:gu3/dn4 24:gu3/dn4 25:gu3/dn4 26:gu3/dn4 27:gu3/dn4 28:gu3/dn3 29:gu3/dn3 30:gu3/dn3 31:gu3/dn3 32:gu3/dn3 33:gu3/dn3 34:gu3/dn3 35:gu3/dn3 36:gu3/dn3 37:gu3/dn3 38:gu3/dn3 39:gu3/dn3
blk.0.ffn_gate_up_exps.*.weight gptq codes=u3 tcq=16 tcq_code=mad tcq_rows=512 block=1x* scale=f32 tcq_colf=1 transform=fwht128 tcq_gain=1.08 damp=0.01 calib=$CALIB tcq_order=1
